  "doctrine": {
    "summary": "Large mobilised force fighting a full-scale defensive war against Russia since 2022. Mixes Soviet-legacy armour and artillery with Western-donated vehicles and the world's most developed drone force (Unmanned Systems Forces branch). The front is a deep 'kill zone' saturated by FPV and bomber drones, so infantry moves in small dispersed groups, vehicles rarely approach the line in daylight, and logistics run at night or by ground robots.",
    "squad_size": 9,
    "fireteam": "Nominal 9-man squad (BMP-style); in practice assault groups of 4-6 and two-man trench positions, paired with a drone team overhead.",
    "tactics": [
      "dispersed small-group infiltration under drone overwatch",
      "FPV and bomber-drone strikes on vehicles, trenches and supply routes",
      "fortified trench lines, dugouts and minefields as map hazards",
      "night movement with thermal concealment (ponchos, netting)",
      "anti-drone shotguns and EW jammers carried at squad level",
      "counter-battery and HIMARS/155 mm strikes cued by drones",
      "UGV resupply and casualty evacuation",
      "aggressive trench clearing with grenades"
    ],
