  "notes": "Ukraine is a mid-campaign client and battlefield for the eastern_ukraine and black_sea_coast theatres; it does not appear in the early counter-terror game. The existing voxel models are fielded in game by their real operators (Captain-confirmed 2026-10-10): Ukraine received 31 M1A1 Abrams from the US (22+ remaining, 49 M1A1 AIM pledged by Australia), 300+ M2A2 ODS-SA Bradleys, 440 MaxxPro and a small number of M-ATVs (seen from 2023); it fields no AH-1Z. Other notable donated kit not listed above: Challenger 2, CV90, Marder, Stryker, Leopard 1A5, PzH 2000, CAESAR, Krab, M777, Patriot. The PKM, SVD and NSV use 7.62x54R/12.7 mm, which in game can disable vehicles. Drones are the defining feature: the game should model the FPV threat as an audio-cued hazard countered by jammers, shotguns and cover, not as a scripted kill.",
